      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Alice.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 1 as a spirit. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Green-Eyed Spirit of the Dread Mansion</strong> — Dread Mansion</p><p>Status: Active — attached to or influencing Mario</p><p>Alice is a translucent spirit in a tattered Victorian dress whose anger drives the mansion's pursuit. She recognizes Mario as someone who returned, touches his chest, and appears able to influence or possess him.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Withering Touch</strong> — “The Green-Eyed Spirit of the Dread Mansion”</li><li><strong>Incorporeal Movement</strong> — “Ghost / hostile spirit”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/alice</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/alice</code>.</p>",
